# Claude Code sandbox artifacts. The sandboxed `claude` CLI (spawned by
# Domo per session, incl. dogfooding this repo) bind-mounts immutable
# empty files over these alternative-package-manager / submodule config
# paths; the empty anchor files persist on disk and can't be deleted
# from inside the sandbox (EBUSY) — so they'd otherwise show in Domo's
# git panel every session. This repo is pnpm-only (pnpm-workspace.yaml,
# no committed .npmrc) and has no submodules, so an empty stub here is
# never legitimate. Real lockfile is pnpm-lock.yaml.
.npmrc
.yarnrc
.yarnrc.yml
bunfig.toml
package-lock.json
yarn.lock
.gitmodules
